&lt;h3&gt;


  &lt;a href="https://dev.to/alessandro-grosselle/what-nextjss-instant-navigation-looks-like-in-a-multipage-application-34dl"&gt;Next.js Instant Navigation in Multi Page Apps&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Not every Next.js app can "just be an SPA". This post explores which instant navigation features still work in a multi-page app, and where browser-native options can replace them, such as cross-document view transitions, BFCache, and the Speculation Rules API&lt;/p&gt;




