&lt;p&gt;The big new feature here is &lt;code&gt;z.compile()&lt;/code&gt; which lets you pre-compile schemas for much faster parsing. The release also cuts memory use a lot, adds helpers like &lt;code&gt;z.creditCard()&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;z.properties()&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;z.deepPartial()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

