&lt;p&gt;The web part aggregates Microsoft 365 group calendar views from a bounded set of SharePoint team-site sources. Each source uses this format:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/marketing|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;It includes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read-only Microsoft Graph &lt;code&gt;calendarView&lt;/code&gt; access through PnPjs Graph&lt;/li&gt;
