&lt;p&gt;Tenant validation is still needed. If you have SharePoint Online access, please test two representative team-site calendars, site/group pairing, permissions and consent, time zones, partial failures, retry behavior, and narrow web-part layouts. Real screenshots and negative findings are welcome; no tenant screenshots are fabricated.&lt;/p&gt;

